{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Elusives are <strong>tiny creatures</strong> that inhabit our homes, hiding from us and borrowing whatever they need. Humans are so big and clumsy that they do not perceive the <strong>world full of adventure and resources</strong> that extends before their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/ELUSIVE_Concept_1.png?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elusive raiders venture into homes to find precious resources to <strong>help the community thrive</strong>, but they\u2019re also  the most careful not to be captured by animals and other <i>huge</i> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll <strong>explore every corner</strong> of an old haunted house, uncovering new pathways and tunnels within the walls that will lead you to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Promo_Illustration.png?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elusive combines <strong>exploration</strong> with resource and treasure gathering, <strong>crafting</strong>, and <strong>quests\u00a0</strong>in a giant house interconnected by tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE EVERY CORNER OF A HUGE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-3.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All levels are interconnected by tunnels, and exploration blends 3D environments with 2D paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAFT YOUR GEAR AND ENHANCE YOUR ACROBATIC SKILLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-12.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire boots for special jumps, a grappling hook to reach distant places, or the moth dust dash for swift movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIDE AND ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-4.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colossal animals like the Witch's Cat and the Raven are lurking around the house. Hide from them or\u00a0they will eat you up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD A NEW ELUSIVE COMMUNITY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-5.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather together all kinds of materials and treasures, and help thriving a new Elusive community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519500?t=1741189933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519500?t=1741189933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/5551f0644df90bba548bcefe8450fe0630d20965/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741189933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/5551f0644df90bba548bcefe8450fe0630d20965/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741189933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Elusives are <strong>tiny creatures</strong> that inhabit our homes, hiding from us and borrowing whatever they need. Humans are so big and clumsy that they do not perceive the <strong>world full of adventure and resources</strong> that extends before their feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/ELUSIVE_Concept_1.png?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elusive raiders venture into homes to find precious resources to <strong>help the community thrive</strong>, but they\u2019re also  the most careful not to be captured by animals and other <i>huge</i> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll <strong>explore every corner</strong> of an old haunted house, uncovering new pathways and tunnels within the walls that will lead you to hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Promo_Illustration.png?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elusive combines <strong>exploration</strong> with resource and treasure gathering, <strong>crafting</strong>, and <strong>quests\u00a0</strong>in a giant house interconnected by tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE EVERY CORNER OF A HUGE HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-3.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All levels are interconnected by tunnels, and exploration blends 3D environments with 2D paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAFT YOUR GEAR AND ENHANCE YOUR ACROBATIC SKILLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-12.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire boots for special jumps, a grappling hook to reach distant places, or the moth dust dash for swift movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIDE AND ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-4.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colossal animals like the Witch's Cat and the Raven are lurking around the house. Hide from them or\u00a0they will eat you up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD A NEW ELUSIVE COMMUNITY</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/extras/Screenshot-5.jpg?t=1741189933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather together all kinds of materials and treasures, and help thriving a new Elusive community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Chibig"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519500/header.jpg?t=1741189933","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095638,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095638/movie480.mp4?t=1741189931","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095638/movie_max.mp4?t=1741189931"},"name":"Elusive - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095638/131570db612599